* GS61008T typical scalar parameters - official datasheet Rev 200402
* EXTERNAL_DEVICE_DATA, not values printed in P24/P25.
* Conditions/meaning must remain attached to each value.
.param GS61008T_VRATED=100
.param GS61008T_RDS_TYP_25C=7m
.param GS61008T_COSS_TYP=250p
.param GS61008T_COER_0_50V=302p
.param GS61008T_COTR_0_50V=385p
.param GS61008T_QOSS_50V=20n
* COTR is used only as a first-order timing equivalent. It is specified for a
* 0-to-50-V transition; the present approximately 12-V transition is an
* extrapolation unless the nonlinear Coss/Qoss curve is implemented.
